WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Some people think
having a busy calendar

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.570
shows how important they are.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.410
Not true.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:07.710
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:10.590
Whether you're a teacher or
a leader or a small business

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.000
owner, after you
take this class,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.690
you will emerge a better
thinker, a better listener,

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:19.020
a better analyzer of problems.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.570
In this class, I teach you: how
did I motivate an organization?

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:24.010
How did I set a direction?

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.250
How did I make sure the
company stayed successful

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.920
over multiple years?

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.260
You've got to understand
how any decision made

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.860
at the top translates all the
way down to the frontline.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.310
And that's what makes you an
effective and efficient leader.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:42.680
I'm Indra Nooyi, and
this is MasterClass.

